//!
//! Serves the plugin-owned schema JSON on:
//!   - native gRPC over Unix socket `/run/opdbus/zeroclaw-grpc.sock`
//!   - HTTP/1.1 + gRPC-Web on TCP `0.0.0.0:8090` (configurable via D-Bus)
